# What must never reach GitHub, and why.
#
# This working folder is about 31 GB. Almost none of it belongs in a repository:
# the dataset videos, two virtual environments and the INCLUDE download make up
# all of it. What is committed is the code, the trained models (3 MB and 250 kB),
# the keypoint recordings that let someone retrain, and the poster images the
# Learn page needs.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- environments
venv/
.venv/
env/
INCLUDE/venv/
isl-translator/fingerspell/action_venv/
*.egg-info/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- node/vite
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.local

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ------------------------------------------------------- video and raw datasets
# 11 GB of INCLUDE clips, downloaded with live/fetch_videos.py - the README says
# how to fetch them again.
isl-translator/live/data/videos/
isl-translator/live/data/keypoints/
isl-translator/live/data/reference_only/
isl-translator/live/reference/
isl-translator/live/demo/
isl-translator/live.zip
isl-translator/**/MP_Data/
*.mp4
*.MOV
*.MP4
*.avi
*.zip

# The signer's own reference takes are video of a person; keep them local unless
# the person whose face is in them decides otherwise.
isl-translator/live/data/reference_self/

# The INCLUDE project and its 196 MB checkpoint are someone else's work and are
# downloaded, not authored here.
INCLUDE/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- artefacts
isl-translator/live/models/*_previous.pt
isl-translator/live/models/*_reverted.pt
isl-translator/live/models/try_*.pt
# Older copies of the same weights: signs.pt is the one the app loads, and on a
# slow connection each spare 3 MB checkpoint is another minute of upload.
isl-translator/live/models/signs_best87.pt
isl-translator/live/models/signs_round1.pt
isl-translator/fingerspell/models/letters_random.pt
isl-translator/fingerspell/models/letters_round1.pt
isl-translator/fingerspell/models/letters_time.pt
isl-translator/live/models/_debug*
isl-translator/live/models/partial*
isl-translator/live/logs/
isl-translator/**/Logs/
isl-translator/backend/data/sessions.json
isl-translator/fingerspell/data/letters_asrecorded_backup/
isl-translator/fingerspell/action_check.json

